# Game client hard-stops

The shipped game is a normal offline Preact + Vite app.

Never add to `src/` or client dependencies:

- Camera (`getUserMedia`) or geolocation
- Ads, analytics, or monitoring (`gtag`, Sentry, Plausible, similar)
- Cloud auth, OAuth, email, or sync
- LLM / agent SDKs (OpenAI, LangChain, LangGraph, similar)
- Next.js, SSR, Electron, Firebase, Supabase

Do not put execution graphs in `src/`. Do not call network models from the child-facing client.

`npm test` must fail if `src/` contains `geolocation`, `getUserMedia`, `gtag`, `Sentry`, `openai`, or `langgraph`.
